### Testing API dengan ekstensi VS Code "REST Client" (humao.rest-client)
### Klik "Send Request" di atas setiap request.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### List admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin

### Cari admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin?search=adm

### Detail admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/1

### Tambah admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "budi",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### Update admin (field opsional)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "budi_update",
  "password": "passwordbaru"
}

### Hapus admin
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/2

